  "body": "Partial fix for #962: the camcraft-mcp skill now lists `rename_operation` and `reorder_operation` (PR #959, merged), in its tool reference and its shipped-capabilities list. Parameter shapes and undo notes are taken from `crates/app/src/mcp/order_tools.rs` on upstream main.\n\nNot in this PR (still open PRs, left out so the skill never names tools main lacks): `set_operation_coolant`, `edit_tool`, `pick_in_box`, `set_units`, `facet_budget`.\n\nFork process files at PROCESS_VERSION 30 (fork synced at v0.18.0).\n\nPinning test: none (docs and process only, no Rust changes). Gate: `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main --dry-run` maps no test binaries.\n\nPROCESS_VERSION bump 33 -> 34 (camcraft-mcp skill).\n\n#681 announcement for the merger:\n`PROCESS_VERSION 34` · PR #1161 · camcraft-mcp skill lists rename_operation/reorder_operation · forks: sync process files\n\nChangelog: none\n\nRefs #962\n\n\n",
